# Forms & UI Patterns

## Layout (desktop)
- Forms in `.form-panel form` or `class="form-layout-adaptive"`
- 2 columns ≥769px; 3 columns ≥1280px for complex forms
- `form-span-full` — textarea, file upload, permission grids, section blocks
- `form-span-2` — wide optional fields in 3-col layout
- Checkbox in grid: auto-aligned via `.form-group:has(> .app-checkbox)` CSS

## Layout (mobile)
- Single column; FormHost full-page; FAB for create
- Ingredient/compact rows: stack in bordered cards
- **Back navigation stack:** form (`FormHost` / `appForm`) → overlay (`useOverlayBack` / `appOverlay`, `appDocPreview`, …) — back closes top layer first

## Mobile overlay back (mandatory)
- New overlays/sheets/previews on mobile: wire **`useOverlayBack`**
- Do not rely on `@click.self` alone — PWA back must close overlay, not navigate away
- Nested case (form + preview): FormHost ignores popstate while overlay active; form closes only when its history entry is popped

## Transaction attachments
- Use **`TransactionAttachmentsField`** (not single `FileUpload`) for income/cost forms
- Gate with `attachments.view` / `attachments.add` / `attachments.delete` (`canView` / `canAdd` / `canDelete`)
- `form-span-full`; multipart sends multiple `documents`
- In `useEntityForm` `onReset`: clear `existingAttachments` only when `!editing` (create mode)
- `startEdit`: call `openEdit(...)` first, then set `existingAttachments` from `item.attachments`

## Document preview
- **`DocumentPreview`**: in-app preview (image iframe/PDF); download link secondary
- List rows: **`DocumentAttachmentList`** + **`DocumentAttachmentButton`**
- Mobile preview uses `useOverlayBack` with `stateKey: 'appDocPreview'`

## User permissions UI
- **`PermissionMatrix`** in user form — desktop 2-col module cards; mobile full-width clickable rows (48px)
- Search + bulk toggles on desktop; sticky save bar on mobile user form

## Shell: branding + user identity
- **Separate concerns:** org brand (`AppBrandMark`) vs signed-in user (`AppAccountChip`)
- **Desktop sidebar:** brand block at top → nav → account chip footer (avatar + username → `/profile`)
- **Mobile top bar:** page title center; avatar chip on end; logo on primary tabs; **back** when form page or **`activeOverlay`** open
- Reuse `EntityAvatar` for all user avatars; fallback to initials when image missing

## Validation
- Frontend: `useFormValidation` + rules object; Persian messages
- Password: `passwordFieldRules()` from `utils/passwordPolicy.js`
- Backend must mirror policy via `PasswordStrengthAttribute`

## Clear buttons (ClearableInput, AppSelect, CurrencyInput, date field)
- **Not tab-focusable:** `tabindex="-1"`, `@mousedown.prevent`, `aria-hidden="true"`
- Mouse click still clears; keyboard: **Esc** on focused text/currency input

## Select & date
- `AppSelect` / `PersonSelect` — desktop dropdown, mobile bottom sheet
- `PersianDatePicker` — `variant="bar"` in toolbars, `field` in forms

## Reports / dense tables
- Use scoped `.report-table` with `table-layout: fixed`, `.num` columns LTR-aligned
- KPI cards: horizontal label/value (`justify-content: space-between`)

## Theming
- Tokens in `frontend/src/style.css`; picker in `stores/theme.js`
- Dark `midnight`: neutral black/gray only — no blue surfaces
- Light themes: pastel `--bg-gradient` + glass cards (`--surface-glass`, blur, inset shine)
- See skill `.cursor/skills/jame-jafari-theming/SKILL.md` before editing colors

## Do not
- Auto-fill login or suggested prices without user action (hints OK)
- Use full-width single column on desktop for 6+ field forms
- Add default `0` in amount/price inputs — use empty string placeholders
